        {
          "book": "2KI",
          "chapter": 6,
          "verse": 5
        }
      ],
      "en": "But as one was cutting down a tree, the ax head fell into the water. Then he cried out and said, “Alas, my master! For it was borrowed.”",
      "ko": "한 사람이 나무를 벨 때에 도끼가 자루에서 빠져 물에 떨어진지라 이에 외쳐 가로되 아아, 내 주여 이는 빌어온 것이니이다",
      "source_text_hash": "a18a96a00de377a977825cb74f4cfd1d2aa78ffad5f3a40b81b2ab0ee55967d5",
      "translation_text_hash": "77928fedfba725e4732456ffc60cce59dd5b9902572f1ea457f880162adb321a",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
