      "en": "He said, “Take it.” So he put out his hand and took it.",
      "ko": "가로되 너는 취하라 그 사람이 손을 내밀어 취하니라",
      "source_text_hash": "a38db368043082fa9fff5e0bb903d08af6c6e09d0009814a38d274430b136170",
      "translation_text_hash": "b47f6d743e3b9cc15ce6ed6b90fb3536301b36b9b6a965fc17131e23261da9bb",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
