      "en": "While he was still talking with them, behold, the messenger came down to him. Then he said, “Behold, this evil is from the LORD. Why should I wait for the LORD any longer?”",
      "ko": "무리와 말씀할 때에 그 사자가 이르니라 왕이 가로되 이 재앙이 여호와께로부터 나왔으니 어찌 더 여호와를 기다리리요",
      "source_text_hash": "ba9030dbd738b228a1e0bbe38831b7efc863317845fec140f4f78bb5cf09cac8",
      "translation_text_hash": "45d7a7b248c08190a3d04ebb94be4149071b875a4ac1b0575950c0e1373a29c5",
